  <h1>What is WebAssembly, exactly?</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>By Coldwast</span><span>Updated Aug 2, 2026</span><span>7 min read</span><span class="tag">#wasm</span><span class="tag">#compilers</span><span class="tag">#web</span></div>
  <nav class="toc" id="toc"></nav>
  <figure>
    <img class="hero" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/20034017/pexels-photo-20034017.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" alt="Shipping containers stacked several rows high against a blue sky" width="1200" height="420" loading="eager" />
